DTSTART:20260723T133000Z
DTEND:20260723T143000Z
DTSTAMP:20260815T104907Z
UID:395810bc85828aeb638f@psc-calendar
CATEGORIES:CO,Public Comment Hearing
DESCRIPTION:Commission: Colorado Public Utilities Commission (CO)\nType: P
 ublic Comment Hearing\n\n<p>The Colorado Public Utilities Commission (PUC)
  will visit the Western Slope and host a listening session\, “Coffee wit
 h the PUC\,” with local residents. The public is invited to join PUC Cha
 ir Eric Blank and PUC Director Rebecca White on the morning of Thursday\, 
 July 23 in Grand Junction. </p><p>The “Coffee with the PUC” will be an
  informal event to learn more about the PUC’s work and meet its Chair an
 d Director. Grab your favorite morning brew and join a casual discussion a
 bout the PUC’s consumer protection role in regulating energy utilities\,
  rideshares\, towing companies\, pipelines\, telecom\n\nSource: https://ca
 lendar.google.com/calendar/ical/state.co.us_mie9aqkvh15rk34shmhs6mnfq8%40g
 roup.calendar.google.com/public/basic.ics
PRIORITY:9
URL:https://calendar.google.com/calendar/ical/state.co.us_mie9aqkvh15rk34s
 hmhs6mnfq8%40group.calendar.google.com/public/basic.ics
END:VEVENT
